    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/87c9e9974abefc36f9935cc0f48dd270.avif?t=1745446709\" /></div><br>In <strong>Liberation Mutagenix</strong>, you must guide your comrades to freedom by whatever means necessary. Place flags to direct their movement, manipulate their genetic code to achieve the impossible, use jetpacks to open up new avenues of mobility, and take control of gravity itself to reach victory. And don't be afraid of a little sacrifice for the greater good. Everything's on the table.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/e14361e2524c3470b1f8d15d642c1484.poster.avif?t=1745446709\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/e14361e2524c3470b1f8d15d642c1484.apng?t=1745446709\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Over 50 levels spanning 4 worlds</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/e3f6268fe360010f5ab20b226df3caf0.poster.avif?t=1745446709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/e3f6268fe360010f5ab20b226df3caf0.webm?t=1745446709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/e3f6268fe360010f5ab20b226df3caf0.mp4?t=1745446709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>3 genetic states, each with their own unique abilities and synergies</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/83e56b5cea62e773a3f86f896cdb1fd6.poster.avif?t=1745446709\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/83e56b5cea62e773a3f86f896cdb1fd6.webm?t=1745446709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1572970/extras/83e56b5cea62e773a3f86f896cdb1fd6.mp4?t=1745446709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Unlockable end-game content offering new ways of completing past levels</strong></li></ul>",
